Package: flow
Version: 0.1.0
Section: net
Priority: optional
Architecture: amd64
Depends: dotnet-runtime-10.0, libbpf1, libelf1, zlib1g
Maintainer: Flow Project <flow@example.invalid>
Description: Network usage monitor with per-process attribution
 Flow records real interface-level and per-process network usage in SQLite and
 presents it through a desktop application with honest attribution caveats.
 This is a prototype package; see /usr/share/doc/flow/README.md.
